        <h2 class="cx-final-title" data-reveal="up">A Box That Survives the Trip <em>Is the Whole Point</em></h2>
        <p class="cx-final-sub" data-reveal="up">Send a size, a product photo or finished artwork, and a structure recommendation comes back with the quote. Approve the sample, and the batch that ships is the one that was signed off.</p>
        <div class="section-cta" data-reveal="up">
